<svg width="100%" viewBox="0 0 680 580" role="img" style="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <title style="fill:rgb(0, 0, 0);stroke:none;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:&quot;Anthropic Sans&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto">EKS Production Platform — Architecture</title>
  <desc style="fill:rgb(0, 0, 0);stroke:none;color:rgb(255, 255, 255);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:&quot;Anthropic Sans&quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto">Architecture diagram showing the full CI/CD and infrastructure stack: GitHub Actions with OIDC auth, Amazon ECR, EKS cluster inside a VPC with private/public subnets, Prometheus, Grafana, Flask app with HPA, and Terraform managing all infrastructure via S3 remote state.</desc>
